      <title>提示链把复杂任务拆成有序子任务流水线</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260831/%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E9%93%BE%E6%8A%8A%E5%A4%8D%E6%9D%82%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%8B%86%E6%88%90%E6%9C%89%E5%BA%8F%E5%AD%90%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1%E6%B5%81%E6%B0%B4%E7%BA%BF/</link>
